*> vybe-test: cobol/set_statement/test_set_index_to_index
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_set_statement.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TABLE.
   05 WS-ITEM PIC 9(3) OCCURS 5 TIMES INDEXED BY WS-IDX1 WS-IDX2.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE 777 TO WS-ITEM(4).
    SET WS-IDX1 TO 4.
    SET WS-IDX2 TO WS-IDX1.
    DISPLAY WS-ITEM(WS-IDX2).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ITEM(WS-IDX2) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "777"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [777] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

